# Environment template
#
# Initial state:
# - No environment variables are required by every Coretsia application.
# - Add documented, non-sensitive examples here as the application needs them.
#
# Local usage:
# - Copy to ".env" when local environment overrides are needed.
# - Keep ".env" out of version control and use ".env.example" only for non-sensitive examples.
